{"unit_id":"tuanmaoOVO__dsh-memory-manager#feature-3","repo":"tuanmaoOVO/dsh-memory-manager","commit":"661d667840896472a6acd5230cfdfd698df162fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-manager 的功能「会话上下文注入」：用户发送消息前，插件把启用的计划记忆和固定文本整理成上下文并追加到本次请求。用户在面板开关模式、增删计划内容或固定文本来控制注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:261-294","lib/plan.js:17-63"]}
{"unit_id":"tuanmaoOVO__dsh-memory-manager#feature-4","repo":"tuanmaoOVO/dsh-memory-manager","commit":"661d667840896472a6acd5230cfdfd698df162fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-manager 的功能「会话总结」：从指定会话读取对话轮次，调用 DSH 当前模型整理请求、处理和结果，并把总结保存为记忆。用户可选择最近轮次并请求合并连续事务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/llm.js:110-137","lib/llm.js:146-197"]}
{"unit_id":"tuanmaoOVO__dsh-memory-manager#feature-5","repo":"tuanmaoOVO/dsh-memory-manager","commit":"661d667840896472a6acd5230cfdfd698df162fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-manager 的功能「记忆图谱」：客户端以浮层展示记忆及其链接关系，支持全景或聚焦浏览，并能沿关联跳转到相关记忆。点击面板中的图谱入口打开。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:944-968","lib/client.js:1279-1285"]}
{"unit_id":"tuanmaoOVO__dsh-memory-manager#caveat-1","repo":"tuanmaoOVO/dsh-memory-manager","commit":"661d667840896472a6acd5230cfdfd698df162fd","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-manager 使用会话总结或生成印象标签时，会把相关文本交给 DSH 当前选定模型处理；模型服务由宿主配置决定。若不希望内容进入该模型请求，可避免使用这些 LLM 辅助功能。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/llm.js:18-42"]}
